Ms. Marchbanks, Ardsley Financial Group withdraws its notice of claim of No=
vember 12, 2024 against VAA interiors + architecture in its entirety. The f=
ormal withdrawal is attached.<br />
<br />
Ardsley does not dispute the authenticity of the produced documents. Our cl=
ient's construction correspondence for this project did not survive its 201=
7 platform consolidation and neither Ms. Truscott nor Mr. Threadgill remain=
s with the company. The claim was prepared on the basis of the finish sched=
ule and the forensic report, which together supported it. The May 17, 2011 =
direction and the October 8, 2013 letter do not merely undercut that positi=
on, they foreclose it.<br />
<br />
The demand of $2,150,000 is withdrawn. Ardsley will fund the remediation of=
 floors 12 through 17 itself. Ardsley makes no claim against VAA in connect=
ion with the flooring assembly on floors 12 through 19 at Corbin Tower.
